length: the history stopped at `A.stoppingTime O X Y`
(the history of an arbitrary number of rounds if `A` never stops). -/
noncomputable def stoppedHist (A : IdentAlg 𝓞 𝓐 𝓨 𝓓)
    (O : ℕ → Ω → 𝓞) (X : ℕ → Ω → 𝓐) (Y : ℕ → Ω → 𝓨) :
